   "artefactDesc": "A structured pre-audit document specifying: each evaluation method to be used (heuristic review, analytics analysis, user testing, etc.), the rationale for each method's inclusion, the specific audit questions each method will address, the data sources to be accessed, and the quality assurance process — serving as both a planning tool and a limitations disclosure."
